tools.description:
Edit a video through the same operations as the editor. Supply baseRev from video_get_doc. A conflict returns the fresh document and rev; re-plan, never blindly retry old ops. label describes the step in undo history. No hosted LLM is invoked. edit_video ops (each op is an object with an "op" field; seconds at the doc fps):
title {value}
brand {colors?: {primary,secondary,text,background}, fonts?: {heading,body,display,numerals,serif,mono,accent}, logos?: {light?: asset id|null, dark?: asset id|null}, motion?: calm|default|punchy}
add_scene {block, after?: scene id|"start"|"end", seconds?, props?, transition?: none|fade|slide|wipe|zoom|diagonal-wipe, transition_seconds?}
add_media_scene {asset, after?: scene id|"start"|"end", seconds?, fit?: cover|contain, transition?}  a full-frame scene showing an uploaded image or clip (asset is an id from the document's media)
add_layer {block, scene, offset?, seconds?, props?, region?}  or {block, at, seconds?} to pin it across scenes
text {target, field, value}  target is a scene id or layer id
set_prop {target, key, value}
bind {target, key, binding: colors.primary|colors.secondary|colors.text|colors.background|fonts.heading|fonts.body|fonts.display|fonts.numerals|fonts.serif|fonts.mono|fonts.accent|null}
scene_length {scene, seconds}
fit_length {seconds}  stretches or trims the holds of all scenes
layer_timing {layer, offset?, seconds?}
transition {scene, kind: none|fade|slide|wipe|zoom|diagonal-wipe, seconds?, timing?: linear|spring, direction?: right|left|top|bottom, all?: true}
swap_block {target, block}
region {layer, region: full|center|upper-third|lower-third|left-half|right-half|corner-tl|corner-br, size?: 16:9|9:16|1:1}
hide_in_size {layer, size, hidden}
move_scene {scene, to}  to is the 1-based position
remove {id}
duplicate {id}
music {track: name from the music list | null, db?}
add_audio {role: voice|music, asset}  put an uploaded audio file (asset id from the document's media) on the timeline
asset_slot {scene, slot, asset: asset id|null}  fill a media field of a scene block (e.g. a phone screen) with an uploaded image or clip
audio {id, db?, fade_in?, fade_out?, duck?, fit_to_video?}
split_audio {id, at_frame}
export_sizes {sizes: [16:9|9:16|1:1]}
video {fade_out?, background?: hex|null}
captions {items?: [{text,startMs,endMs}], position?, per_page?, lines?, remove?}
replace_text {find, replace}
note {label}  explain without changing anything
